{"id":"e73edb1b90c3736c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/832_Boolean_代数逻辑.md","title":"832 Boolean 代数逻辑","display":"832_Boolean_代数逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。Boolean 代数逻辑的构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\quad \\neg,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot,\\quad \\neg,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其内部构造子的型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生蕴含：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\to B:=\\neg A\\vee B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\to B:=\\neg A\\vee B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-变元出现与替换\">3. 变元出现与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及替换扩张算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{BA}}:\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{BA}}:\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>，令\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\sigma)\\)</span> 为唯一满足下列子句的映射：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定排除条款：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(A)=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}),\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{BA}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(A)=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}),\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{BA}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由变元函数别名与替换函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\qquad\n\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\qquad\n\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma\\)</span> 不需要 fresh 选择或捕获避免重命名；替换只按上述构造子递归。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-Boolean-代数\">4. Boolean 代数</h1>\n<p>Boolean 代数为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B=(B,\\le,0,1,\\neg,\\wedge,\\vee)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf B=(B,\\le,0,1,\\neg,\\wedge,\\vee)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(B\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0,1\\in B,\\qquad\n\\le\\ \\subseteq B^2,\\qquad\n\\neg:B\\to B,\\qquad\n\\wedge,\\vee:B^2\\to B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0,1\\in B,\\qquad\n\\le\\ \\subseteq B^2,\\qquad\n\\neg:B\\to B,\\qquad\n\\wedge,\\vee:B^2\\to B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足下列全部条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 上偏序：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le a,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le a)\\Rightarrow a=b,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le c)\\Rightarrow a\\le c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le a,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le a)\\Rightarrow a=b,\\qquad\n(a\\le b\\wedge b\\le c)\\Rightarrow a\\le c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,\\le,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee)\">\\((B,\\le,0,1,\\wedge,\\vee)\\)</span> 是有界分配格，展开为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a,\\quad\na\\vee b=b\\vee a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a,\\quad\na\\vee b=b\\vee a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c),\\quad\n(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c),\\quad\n(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge a=a,\\quad a\\vee a=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge a=a,\\quad a\\vee a=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a,\\quad\na\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a,\\quad\na\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0\\le a,\\quad a\\le1,\\quad\na\\le b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee b=b,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0\\le a,\\quad a\\le1,\\quad\na\\le b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee b=b,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge(b\\vee c)=(a\\wedge b)\\vee(a\\wedge c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge(b\\vee c)=(a\\wedge b)\\vee(a\\wedge c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\vee(b\\wedge c)=(a\\vee b)\\wedge(a\\vee c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\vee(b\\wedge c)=(a\\vee b)\\wedge(a\\vee c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>补运算满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge\\neg a=0,\n\\qquad\na\\vee\\neg a=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge\\neg a=0,\n\\qquad\na\\vee\\neg a=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异是补律被作为结构方程加入；Heyting 代数不要求该方程。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-赋值递归\">5. 赋值递归</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BoolAlg}\">\\(\\mathsf{BoolAlg}\\)</span> 为所有 Boolean 代数。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BoolAlg}\">\\(\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BoolAlg}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to B\">\\(v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to B\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=v(p),\n\\quad\n\\llbracket\\operatorname{bot}\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=v(p),\n\\quad\n\\llbracket\\operatorname{bot}\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\\neg\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\\neg\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\\wedge\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\\wedge\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\\vee\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\\vee\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-有效式与后承\">6. 有效式与后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}:\n\\forall\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BoolAlg}\\,\n\\forall v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to B\\,\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}:\n\\forall\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BoolAlg}\\,\n\\forall v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to B\\,\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义主后承关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n\\ \\subseteq\\\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\models_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n\\ \\subseteq\\\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span>，定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{BA}}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{BA}}A\\)</span> 当且仅当对所有\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BoolAlg}\">\\(\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BoolAlg}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to B\">\\(v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to B\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=1\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=1\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"7.-反例证书\">7. 反例证书</h1>\n<p>反例证书集合定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BA}}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n\\to\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BoolAlg}}\n\\{\\mathbf B\\}\\times B^{\\mathsf{Prop}}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BA}}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n\\to\n\\mathcal P\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BoolAlg}}\n\\{\\mathbf B\\}\\times B^{\\mathsf{Prop}}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{(\\mathbf B,v):\n\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BoolAlg},\\\nv:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{(\\mathbf B,v):\n\\mathbf B\\in\\mathsf{BoolAlg},\\\nv:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\,\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=1,\n\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\\ne1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\,\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}=1,\n\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf B,v}^{\\mathsf{BA}}\\ne1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由定义立即有可检查的证书判据：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{BA}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{BA}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BA}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式证明规则关系声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>不定义非空证明对象。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>Boolean 代数逻辑为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\mathsf{BoolAlg},\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\mathsf{BoolAlg},\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span> 仅由本条目的 Boolean 代数结构、赋值递归、指定值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span> 定义；不得把 Heyting 非布尔模型或证明规则隐式加入。</p>\n<p>该系统只含命题句法、命题替换、Boolean 代数、语义公理集合和后承关系；不含 Heyting 非布尔结构或证明论对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-变元出现与替换","text":"3. 变元出现与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-Boolean-代数","text":"4. Boolean 代数","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值递归","text":"5. 赋值递归","level":1},{"id":"6.-有效式与后承","text":"6. 有效式与后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-反例证书","text":"7. 反例证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\quad \\neg,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\to B:=\\neg A\\vee B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{